  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asia Pacific Observatory on Health Systems and Policies (APO)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to the Asia Pacific Observatory on Health Systems and Policies (APO) to support activities in their APO Business Plan 2024-2027 including publication of country health system reviews and the development of policy briefs on high priority health issues in the Indo Pacific region. APO is a regional partnership of governments, international agencies, foundations and researchers, hosted by the World Health Organization. The APO promotes evidence-informed decision-making in health systems at regional, national and subnational levels through the Indo Pacific region.</narrative>
  </description>
